{
  "title": "S3 · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "Region 단위의 내구성 높은 객체 스토리지다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>S3 <span class=\"full-name\">(Simple Storage Service)</span></span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#buckets-objects-and-keys\">Buckets, Objects and Keys</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#general-purpose-buckets\">General Purpose Buckets</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#directory-buckets-and-s3-express-one-zone\">Directory Buckets and S3 Express One Zone</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#table-buckets-and-vector-buckets\">Table Buckets and Vector Buckets</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#strong-consistency\">Strong Consistency</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#versioning-and-delete-markers\">Versioning and Delete Markers</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#lifecycle-rules\">Lifecycle Rules</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#replication\">Replication</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#object-ownership-and-block-public-access\">Object Ownership and Block Public Access</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#bucket-policies-access-points-and-iam\">Bucket Policies, Access Points and IAM</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#encryption\">Encryption</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#presigned-urls\">Presigned URLs</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#multipart-upload-and-transfer-acceleration\">Multipart Upload and Transfer Acceleration</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#object-lock\">Object Lock</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#event-notifications-and-batch-operations\">Event Notifications and Batch Operations</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#static-website-hosting-and-cloudfront\">Static Website Hosting and CloudFront</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#inventory-storage-lens-and-access-logs\">Inventory, Storage Lens and Access Logs</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>스토리지</span><span>45 / 62</span></div><h1>S3 <span class=\"full-name\">(Simple Storage Service)</span></h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 17 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>Amazon S3 <span class=\"full-name\">(Simple Storage Service)</span>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#buckets-objects-and-keys\">Bucket</a>과 Object API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span>를 사용하는 관리형 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#object-storage\">Object Storage</a>다. Object는 Key로 식별하며 데이터와 Metadata를 가진다. 계층처럼 보이는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#buckets-objects-and-keys\">Prefix</a>도 일반 File System의 Directory와 동일한 물리 구조는 아니다.</p><p>설계는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#buckets-objects-and-keys\">Bucket</a> 유형·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a>, 접근 권한, Encryption, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#versioning-and-delete-markers\">Versioning</a>, Storage Class와 Lifecycle을 차례로 정한다. S3 <span class=\"full-name\">(Simple Storage Service)</span>의 높은 내구성이 실수 삭제·잘못된 권한·악성 변경까지 자동으로 막아 주는 것은 아니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"업로드·보호·배포\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>업로드·보호·배포</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Data lifecycle</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Upload Object</strong><small><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#buckets-objects-and-keys\">Bucket</a> + Key</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#versioning-and-delete-markers\">Versioning</a> + Lifecycle</strong><small>변경 보존·Class 전환</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Archive / Expiration</strong><small>보관 정책 적용</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Private distribution</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Private <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#buckets-objects-and-keys\">Bucket</a></strong><small>Public Access 차단</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CloudFront</a> OAC <span class=\"full-name\">(Origin Access Control)</span></strong><small>Origin 읽기 권한</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Viewer HTTPS <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol Secure)</span></strong><small>Signed URL <span class=\"full-name\">(Uniform Resource Locator)</span>·Cookie 선택</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\"><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#buckets-objects-and-keys\">Bucket</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/\">KMS</a> 권한과 데이터 보존 정책은 각각 설정한다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"buckets-objects-and-keys\"><h2>Buckets, Objects and Keys<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#buckets-objects-and-keys\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#buckets-objects-and-keys\">Bucket</a>은 Object를 담는 관리 경계이고 Key는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#buckets-objects-and-keys\">Bucket</a> 안의 고유 이름이다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#buckets-objects-and-keys\">Prefix</a>로 목록과 정책을 구성하며 Metadata와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#buckets-objects-and-keys\">Object Tag</a>는 목적·사용 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span>가 다르다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#versioning-and-delete-markers\">Versioning</a>이 켜지면 같은 Key에도 여러 Version ID <span class=\"full-name\">(Identifier)</span>가 존재할 수 있다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"general-purpose-buckets\"><h2>General Purpose Buckets<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#general-purpose-buckets\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>일반적인 S3 <span class=\"full-name\">(Simple Storage Service)</span> 기능과 여러 Storage Class를 제공한다. 선택 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a>을 기준으로 데이터 위치를 설계한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#buckets-objects-and-keys\">Bucket</a> Name·Endpoint·지원 기능은 다른 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#buckets-objects-and-keys\">Bucket</a> 유형과 동일하다고 가정하지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"directory-buckets-and-s3-express-one-zone\"><h2>Directory Buckets and S3 <span class=\"full-name\">(Simple Storage Service)</span> Express One Zone<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#directory-buckets-and-s3-express-one-zone\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#reference-2\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 2\">[2]</a></h2><p>낮은 지연과 높은 요청 성능이 필요한 Workload에 사용하는 별도 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#buckets-objects-and-keys\">Bucket</a> 모델이다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#s3-express-one-zone\">S3 Express One Zone</a> 데이터는 선택한 한 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>에 저장된다. 인증 방식·Endpoint·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#versioning-and-delete-markers\">Versioning</a> 등 기능 지원이 General Purpose <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#buckets-objects-and-keys\">Bucket</a>과 다르다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"table-buckets-and-vector-buckets\"><h2>Table Buckets and Vector Buckets<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#table-buckets-and-vector-buckets\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#table-buckets-and-vector-buckets\">S3 Tables</a>는 관리형 Apache Iceberg Table을, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#table-buckets-and-vector-buckets\">S3 Vectors</a>는 Vector 저장·검색 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span>를 제공하는 별도 기능이다. 일반 Object를 업로드하는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#buckets-objects-and-keys\">Bucket</a>과 사용 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span>·지원 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a>이 다르다. 시험의 기본 S3 <span class=\"full-name\">(Simple Storage Service)</span> Object 문제와 최신 목적별 저장 기능을 구분한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"strong-consistency\"><h2>Strong Consistency<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#strong-consistency\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>성공한 Object 쓰기·덮어쓰기·삭제 뒤 읽기와 목록 조회에 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#strong-consistency\">Strong Consistency</a>를 제공한다. 여러 Key에 걸친 관계형 Transaction이나 동시 Writer의 Business Logic Lock을 대신하지 않는다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#replication\">Cross-Region Replication</a>의 완료 시점도 별도다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"versioning-and-delete-markers\"><h2>Versioning and Delete Markers<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#versioning-and-delete-markers\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#versioning-and-delete-markers\">Versioning</a>은 같은 Key의 변경 이력을 보존한다. 일반 삭제는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#versioning-and-delete-markers\">Delete Marker</a>를 추가하며 특정 Version을 영구 삭제하는 작업과 다르다. 오래된 Version의 Storage 비용은 Lifecycle로 관리하고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#versioning-and-delete-markers\">MFA Delete</a>의 지원·관리 조건을 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"lifecycle-rules\"><h2>Lifecycle Rules<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#lifecycle-rules\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>현재·이전 Version을 다른 Storage Class로 Transition하거나 Expiration으로 삭제한다. 미완료 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#multipart-upload-and-transfer-acceleration\">Multipart Upload</a> 정리도 지원한다. 최소 보관 기간·Object 크기·전환 요청 비용을 고려해 빈번히 접근하는 작은 Object를 무조건 Archive하지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"replication\"><h2>Replication<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#replication\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#replication\">Same-Region Replication</a>과 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#replication\">Cross-Region Replication</a>은 지원 Object를 비동기로 복제한다. Source·Destination <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#versioning-and-delete-markers\">Versioning</a>과 Role·Encryption 권한이 필요하다. 기존 Object는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#replication\">S3 Batch Replication</a>을 검토하고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#versioning-and-delete-markers\">Delete Marker</a>·영구 Version 삭제의 복제 조건을 따로 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"object-ownership-and-block-public-access\"><h2>Object Ownership and Block Public Access<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#object-ownership-and-block-public-access\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#object-ownership-and-block-public-access\">Bucket Owner Enforced</a>는 ACL <span class=\"full-name\">(Access Control List)</span>을 비활성화하고 정책으로 권한을 관리한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#object-ownership-and-block-public-access\">Block Public Access</a>는 Public Policy·ACL <span class=\"full-name\">(Access Control List)</span>로 인한 노출을 차단하는 방어선이다. Private <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#buckets-objects-and-keys\">Bucket</a>에 서비스가 접근하려면 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#bucket-policies-access-points-and-iam\">Bucket Policy</a>와 필요한 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a> 권한을 명시한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"bucket-policies-access-points-and-iam\"><h2>Bucket Policies, Access Points and IAM <span class=\"full-name\">(Identity and Access Management)</span><a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#bucket-policies-access-points-and-iam\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#bucket-policies-access-points-and-iam\">Bucket Policy</a>는 Resource 기반, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a> Policy는 Principal 기반 권한이다. Access Point는 공유 데이터에 접근 경로·정책을 분리한다. Explicit Deny, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#organizations-and-organizational-units\">Organizations</a> 제약, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#endpoint-policy-and-private-dns\">Endpoint Policy</a>와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/\">KMS</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#key-policies-iam-and-grants\">Key Policy</a>까지 적용되면 하나의 Allow만으로 접근이 보장되지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"encryption\"><h2>Encryption<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#encryption\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#encryption\">SSE-S3</a>는 S3 <span class=\"full-name\">(Simple Storage Service)</span> 관리 Key, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#encryption\">SSE-KMS</a>와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#encryption\">DSSE-KMS</a>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/\">KMS</a> 기반 Key 제어를 사용한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#encryption\">SSE-C</a>는 요청 시 고객 Key를 제공하고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#encryption\">Client-side Encryption</a>은 업로드 전에 암호화한다. 기본 Encryption과 HTTPS <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol Secure)</span> 전송 보호는 서로 다른 계층이며 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/\">KMS</a> 요청 비용·권한도 고려한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"presigned-urls\"><h2>Presigned URLs <span class=\"full-name\">(Uniform Resource Locators)</span><a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#presigned-urls\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>서명한 Principal의 권한과 만료 조건으로 제한된 Object 작업을 허용한다. 앱이 파일 자체를 중계하지 않고 임시 다운로드·업로드 경로를 제공할 수 있다. URL <span class=\"full-name\">(Uniform Resource Locator)</span>을 소유한 사람의 사용 가능성을 고려하고 서명 자격 증명이 먼저 만료되면 URL <span class=\"full-name\">(Uniform Resource Locator)</span>도 영향을 받는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"multipart-upload-and-transfer-acceleration\"><h2>Multipart Upload and Transfer Acceleration<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#multipart-upload-and-transfer-acceleration\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#multipart-upload-and-transfer-acceleration\">Multipart Upload</a>는 큰 Object를 Part로 병렬 전송하고 실패 Part만 재전송하게 한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#multipart-upload-and-transfer-acceleration\">Transfer Acceleration</a>은 Edge 경로로 장거리 전송을 개선하는 선택지다. 실제 경로에 따라 효과가 달라 비용과 측정 결과를 비교한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"object-lock\"><h2>Object Lock<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#object-lock\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>지원 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#buckets-objects-and-keys\">Bucket</a>에서 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#object-lock\">WORM</a> 보존을 구현한다. Governance Mode는 특별 권한의 우회가 가능하고 Compliance Mode는 보존 기간 중 더 강한 삭제 제한을 제공한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#object-lock\">Legal Hold</a>는 Retention 기간과 별개로 유지하며 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/#vault-lock\">Backup Vault Lock</a>과 적용 리소스가 다르다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"event-notifications-and-batch-operations\"><h2>Event Notifications and Batch Operations<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#event-notifications-and-batch-operations\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Object 생성 등 Event를 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sns/\">SNS</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sqs/\">SQS</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a> 또는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eventbridge/\">EventBridge</a>와 연결할 수 있다. 중복·순서 조건을 고려해 Consumer를 Idempotent하게 만든다. Batch Operations는 많은 기존 Object에 Copy·Tag·Restore 같은 작업을 일괄 실행한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"static-website-hosting-and-cloudfront\"><h2>Static Website Hosting and CloudFront<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#static-website-hosting-and-cloudfront\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Website Endpoint는 Website 기능과 Public 접근 조건을 고려해야 한다. Private S3 <span class=\"full-name\">(Simple Storage Service)</span> Origin을 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CloudFront</a> OAC <span class=\"full-name\">(Origin Access Control)</span>로 연결하면 직접 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#buckets-objects-and-keys\">Bucket</a> 공개 없이 HTTPS <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol Secure)</span> 배포를 설계할 수 있다. S3 <span class=\"full-name\">(Simple Storage Service)</span> Website Endpoint와 S3 <span class=\"full-name\">(Simple Storage Service)</span> REST <span class=\"full-name\">(Representational State Transfer)</span> Origin의 인증·HTTPS <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol Secure)</span> 조건은 다르다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"inventory-storage-lens-and-access-logs\"><h2>Inventory, Storage Lens and Access Logs<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#inventory-storage-lens-and-access-logs\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Inventory는 Object 목록·속성을 주기적으로, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#inventory-storage-lens-and-access-logs\">Storage Lens</a>는 사용·활동 집계를 제공한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#inventory-storage-lens-and-access-logs\">Server Access Logging</a>과 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#cloudtrail-event-history\">CloudTrail</a> Data Events는 요청 관찰·감사에 사용한다. 목적과 지연·비용이 달라 모든 정보를 한 기능에서 실시간으로 얻는다고 가정하지 않는다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>사용자 파일은 Private <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#buckets-objects-and-keys\">Bucket</a>에 저장하고 앱은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#presigned-urls\">Presigned URL</a>로 업로드를 허용한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#versioning-and-delete-markers\">Versioning</a>·Lifecycle을 적용하고 외부 배포는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CloudFront</a> OAC <span class=\"full-name\">(Origin Access Control)</span>로 제한한다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p>S3 <span class=\"full-name\">(Simple Storage Service)</span>를 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>의 파일 시스템이나 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a> 볼륨처럼 생각하지 않는다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonS3/latest/userguide/Welcome.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AmazonS3/latest/userguide/Welcome.html ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-2\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonS3/latest/userguide/directory-buckets-overview.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AmazonS3/latest/userguide/directory-buckets-overview.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q017/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q017\" data-question=\"Q017\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q017</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q017/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A private EC2 instance needs access to S3 without routing S3 traffic through a NAT gateway. What is usually the simplest choice?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q017\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A public Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q017\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">VPC peering</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q017\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An S3 gateway VPC endpoint</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q017\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An Application Load Balancer</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 게이트웨이 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">엔드포인트</a>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">라우트 테이블</a>을 통해 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a>로 사설 경로를 제공한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">VPC Endpoint</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q036\" data-question=\"Q036\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q036</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q036/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An application runs an image transformation that takes a few seconds whenever a file is uploaded. Which option avoids managing servers directly?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q036\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon RDS Multi-AZ</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q036\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Lambda</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q036\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An always-on dedicated EC2 instance only</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q036\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Transit Gateway</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a>는 이벤트 기반의 짧은 코드 실행에 알맞다. 실행 한도와 동시성을 점검한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q040\" data-question=\"Q040\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q040</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q040/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A web application stores image files by key and serves them over HTTP. Which service should it consider first?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q040\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A single EBS volume</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q040\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An ENI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q040\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon S3</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q040\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A network ACL</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a>는 객체 저장과 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> 접근에 적합하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/\">Object / File / Block</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q041\" data-question=\"Q041\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q041</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q041/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants to recover older object versions after an S3 object is overwritten or deleted. Which feature should it enable?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q041\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">NAT</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q041\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An Application Load Balancer</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q041\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">EBS Multi-Attach</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q041\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Versioning</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 버전 관리는 이전 버전을 보존한다. 비용과 삭제 마커도 고려한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q042\" data-question=\"Q042\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q042</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q042/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Compliance records will rarely be accessed for years, and long retrieval times are acceptable. Which storage class is most appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q042\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">EBS gp3</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q042\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Standard</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q042\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">EFS Standard</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q042\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Glacier Deep Archive</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/#s3-glacier-deep-archive\">Deep Archive</a>는 장기 보관과 느린 복원 허용에 맞는다. 최소 보관 기간과 검색 요금도 검토한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/\">S3 Storage Classes</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/\">이전 용어 <b>RPO / RTO</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/\">다음 용어 <b>S3 Storage Classes</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
